{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "task_family": "incremental_english_modern_japanese_overlay",
  "book_id": "genji-modern",
  "chunk_id": "genji-modern-chunk-4474",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04474",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "宰相中将薰君于这一年秋天升任中纳言，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "That autumn, His Lordship Kaoru, the Counselor Captain, was promoted to Middle Counselor,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04474",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "世间声望更加显赫了，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and his reputation in the world grew still more distinguished,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04474",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "然而心中愁思依然甚多。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "yet his heart remained burdened with many sorrows.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04474",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "他多年来心怀疑虑：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "For many years he had carried a doubt in his heart:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04474",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "关于自己的出生究竟是怎么一回事？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "what was the truth about his own birth?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04474",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "近来得知实情后，却更加痛苦，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "After recently learning the truth, however, he suffered all the more,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04474",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "想象他的生父忧惧而死时的情状，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "as he imagined the state in which his real father had died, consumed by grief and fear,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04474",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "便决心代他修行佛道，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and he resolved to practice the Buddhist way on his behalf,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04474",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "借以减轻他的罪业。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "so that his father's burden of sin might be lightened.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04474",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "他怜悯老侍女弁君，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "He felt pity for the elderly gentlewoman Ben no Kimi,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04474",
      "unit_index": 11,
      "source_text": "常常避去人目注意，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and often avoided drawing people's notice,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04474",
      "unit_index": 12,
      "source_text": "以种种借口，对她多加照顾。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "using various pretexts to give her especially careful support.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
